hadiths[41]{hadithnumber,text}:
"993","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen farmaya: Kisi Musalman aadmi ka khoon halal nahin hai jo gawahi deta ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur main Allah ka Rasool hun, siwae teen mein se ek ke: shadi-shuda zinakar, jaan ke badle jaan, aur apne deen ko chhorne wala jama'at se juda hone wala. Muttafaq alaih."
"994","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ka qatl halal nahin hai siwae teen khaslaton mein se ek ke: shadi-shuda zani to rajm kiya jaega; aur woh aadmi jo Musalman ko amdan qatl kare to qatl kiya jaega; aur woh aadmi jo Islam se nikle aur Allah aur Us ke Rasool se lade to qatl kiya jaega, ya sooli di jaegi, ya zameen se jila-watan kiya jaega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"995","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din logon ke darmiyan sab se pahle khoonon mein faisla kiya jaega. Muttafaq alaih."
"996","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam ko qatl kare ham use qatl karenge, aur jo apne ghulam ka naak kaan kaate ham us ka kateng. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha; aur yeh Hasan Basri ki Samurah se riwayat se hai, aur un ke sunne mein ikhtilaf hua hai. Aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ki ek riwayat mein hai: Aur jo apne ghulam ko khasi kare ham use khasi karenge. Aur Hakim ne is ziyadti ko sahih kaha."
"997","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Walid ko aulad ke badle qisas mein qatl nahin kiya jaega. Ise Ahmad, Tirmidhi aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Jarud aur Baihaqi ne ise sahih kaha; aur Tirmidhi ne kaha: Yeh muztarib hai."
"998","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaifah se riwayat hai ke main ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha: Kya tumhare paas Quran ke siwa wahi mein se kuch hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, us ki qasam jis ne dane ko phaada aur jaan ko paida kiya, siwae samajh ke jo Allah Quran mein kisi aadmi ko deta hai, aur jo is saheefe mein hai. Main ne kaha: Aur is saheefe mein kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aql [diyat], qaidi ko chhudana, aur Musalman kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jaega. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne ise doosri wajh se Ali se nikala."
"999","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek ladki pai gayi jis ka sar do pathron ke darmiyan kuchla gaya tha. To unhon ne us se poocha: Tum se yeh kis ne kiya? Falan? Falan? Yahan tak ke unhon ne ek Yahudi ka zikr kiya. To us ne apne sar se ishara kiya. To Yahudi pakda gaya aur iqrar kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke us ka sar do pathron ke darmiyan kuchla jae. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"1000","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke faqeer logon ka ek ladke ne ameer logon ke ladke ka kaan kaata. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae to Aap ne un ke liye kuch na muqarrar kiya. Ise Ahmad aur Salasa ne sahih sanad se riwayat kiya."
"1001","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke ek aadmi ne seeng se doosre aadmi ke ghutne mein mara. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe qisas dilayen. To Aap ne farmaya: Yahan tak ke theek ho jao. Phir woh Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe qisas dilayen. To Aap ne use qisas dilaya. Phir woh Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main langda ho gaya hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tumhen mana kiya tha magar tum ne meri nafarmani ki; Allah tumhen door kare, aur tumhara langdapan batil ho gaya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke zakhm se qisas liya jae yahan tak ke us ka malik theek ho jae. Ise Ahmad aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur ise mursal hone se ma'lul kaha gaya."
"1002","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Huzail ki do aurten ladin to un mein se ek ne doosri ko pathar mara aur use aur jo us ke pet mein tha qatl kar diya. To unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jhagda kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke us ke janeen ki diyat ghulam ya bandi hai, aur aurat ki diyat us ki aaqilah par hone ka faisla farmaya. Aur use us ka beta aur jo un ke sath the waris banaya. To Hamal bin Nabighah Huzali ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Woh kaise jurmana de jo na piya, na khaya, na bola, na roya? To aisa zaya kiya jata hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh to kahinon ke bhaiyon mein se hai; us ke saja' ke sabab jo us ne saja' kiya. Muttafaq alaih; aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne ise Ibn Abbas ki hadees se nikala ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne poocha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke janeen ke faisle par kis ne gawahi di? Unhon ne kaha: To Hamal bin Nabighah khade hue aur kaha: Main do aurton ke darmiyan tha to un mein se ek ne doosri ko mara... Phir mukhtasar zikr kiya. Aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1003","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rubayyi' bint Nadr jo un ki phuphi thin ne ek ladki ka samne ka dant tod diya. To un se mu'afi mangi gayi magar unhon ne inkar kiya; phir diyat pesh ki gayi magar unhon ne inkar kiya. Phir woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae magar qisas ke siwa inkar kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qisas ka hukm diya. To Anas bin Nadr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Rubayyi' ka samne ka dant toda jaega? Nahin, us ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja, us ka dant na toda jaega. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ki kitab mein qisas hai. To woh razi ho gae. Muttafaq alaih."
"1004","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo andhe jhagde ya pathar, kode ya lathi se phenkne mein qatl kiya jae us par khata ki aql hai; aur jo amdan qatl kiya jae woh qisas hai; aur jo us ke darmiyan hael ho us par Allah ki la'nat hai. Ise Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne qawi sanad se riwayat kiya."
"1005","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab ek aadmi doosre aadmi ko pakde aur teesra use qatl kare to jo qatl kare woh qatl kiya jaega aur jo pakde use qaid kiya jaega. Ise Daraqutni ne mausul aur mursal riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Qattan ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ke rijaal siqah hain, magar Baihaqi ne mursal ko tarjeeh di."
"1006","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Bailamani se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zimmi ke badle Musalman ko qatl kiya. Aur farmaya: Main sab se pehla hun jo apne zimme ko poora kare. Ise Abdur Razzaq ne isi tarah mursal nikala; aur Daraqutni ne ise Ibn Umar ke zikr se mausul kiya, aur mausul ki sanad kamzor hai."
"1007","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek ladka dhoke se qatl kiya gaya to Umar ne farmaya: Agar us mein Ahle Sana' shareek hote to main unhen us se qatl karta. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1008","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Shuraih Khuza'i se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir jis ka koi maqtool meri is baat ke baad qatl kiya jae to us ke ghar wale do behtar rayon mein hain: ya diyat len ya qatl karen. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Sahihain mein Abu Hurairah ki hadees se isi ma'na mein hai."
"1009","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm apne walid se, woh apne dada (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Yaman ko likha... Phir hadees zikr ki, aur is mein hai: Beshak jo amdan gawah ke baghair mu'min ko qatl kare woh qisas hai siwae is ke ke maqtool ke wali razi hon; aur beshak jaan mein diyat sau unt hain; aur naak mein jab poori kaat li jae diyat hai; aur zaban mein diyat hai; aur dono honthon mein diyat hai; aur zakar mein diyat hai; aur dono khusion mein diyat hai; aur reedh ki haddi mein diyat hai; aur dono aankhon mein diyat hai; aur ek pair mein aadhi diyat hai; aur dimagh tak pahunchne wale zakhm mein tahai diyat hai; aur pet tak pahunchne wale zakhm mein tahai diyat hai; aur haddi nikalne wale zakhm mein pandrah unt hain; aur hath pair ki unglion mein se har ungli mein dus unt hain; aur dant mein paanch unt hain; aur haddi zahir karne wale zakhm mein paanch unt hain; aur beshak mard aurat ke badle qatl kiya jata hai; aur sone walon par hazaar dinar hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne Maraseel mein, aur Nasai, Ibn Khuzaimah, Ibn Jarud, Ibn Hibban aur Ahmad ne riwayat kiya; aur unhon ne is ki sihat mein ikhtilaf kiya."
"1010","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Khata ki diyat panchwan hai: bees hiqqah, bees jaza'ah, bees bint makhad, bees bint labun aur bees ibn labun. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya; aur Arba'a ne is lafz se riwayat kiya: Aur bees ibn makhad, ibn labun ke badle. Aur pehli ki sanad qawi hai; aur Ibn Abi Shaibah ne ise doosri mauqoof wajh se nikala, aur yeh marfoo' se sahih hai."
"1011","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah par logon mein sab se sakht teen hain: jo Allah ke haram mein qatl kare, ya apne qatil ke siwa qatl kare, ya Jahiliyah ke badle ke liye qatl kare. Ise Ibn Hibban ne ek hadees mein nikala jise unhon ne sahih kaha."
"1012","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar! Beshak khata shibh amd ki diyat jo kode aur lathi se ho sau unt hain, un mein se chalis un ke peton mein un ke bachche hon. Ise Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1013","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Yeh aur yeh barabar hain. Yani chhoti ungli aur angutha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ke han hai: Ungliyon ki diyat barabar hai, aur dant barabar hain: samne ka dant aur dadh barabar hain. Aur Ibn Hibban ke han hai: Dono hathon aur pairon ki ungliyon ki diyat barabar hai, har ungli ke liye dus unt hain."
"1014","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se marfoo'an riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Jo tababat kare jabke woh tibb mein ma'roof na ho aur jaan ya us se kam ko nuqsan pahunchaye to woh zaman hai. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur yeh Abu Dawud, Nasai aur ghair ke han hai, magar jis ne ise mursal kiya woh jis ne ise mausul kiya us se qawi hai."
"1015","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haddi zahir karne wale zakhmon mein paanch paanch unt hain. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad ne izafa kiya: Aur ungliyan barabar hain, sab dus dus unt hain. Aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Jarud ne ise sahih kaha."
"1016","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zimmi ki aql Musalmanon ki aql ki aadhi hai. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ke alfaz hain: Mu'ahid ki diyat aazad ki diyat ki aadhi hai. Aur Nasai ke han hai: Aurat ki aql mard ki aql jaisi hai yahan tak ke us ki diyat ke tahai tak pahunche. Aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"1017","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shibah amd ki aql amd ki aql jaisi bhari hai, magar us ka malik qatl nahin kiya jata; aur yeh is liye ke shaitan uchhalta hai aur logon ke darmiyan baghair keena aur hathyar uthae khoon hota hai. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur ise za'if kaha."
"1018","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aadmi ko qatl kiya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki diyat barah hazaar muqarrar farmayi. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Nasai aur Abu Hatim ne is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di."
"1019","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ramsah se riwayat hai ke main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur mere sath mera beta tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Yeh kaun hai? Main ne kaha: Mera beta hai, main us se gawahi deta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardar! Beshak woh tum par zulm na karega aur na tum us par zulm karoge. Ise Nasai aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Jarud ne ise sahih kaha."
"1020","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Abi Hasmah se apni qaum ke bade aadmiyon se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisah bin Mas'ud Khaibar ki taraf nikle ek mohtaji se jo unhen pahunchi thi. To Muhayyisah ke paas aaya gaya aur use khabar di gayi ke Abdullah bin Sahl qatl kar diye gae hain aur kunwen mein phenk diye gae hain. To woh Yahud ke paas aaya aur kaha: Allah ki qasam tum ne use qatl kiya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam ham ne use qatl nahin kiya. Phir woh, us ka bhai Huwayyisah aur Abdur Rahman bin Sahl aae. To Muhayyisah bolne laga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bade ko bade, murad umar thi. To Huwayyisah bola, phir Muhayyisah bola. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ya to tumhare sathi ki diyat den ya jang ki ijazat den. To Aap ne unhen is bare mein likha. To unhon ne likha: Beshak ham ne Allah ki qasam use qatl nahin kiya. To Aap ne Huwayyisah, Muhayyisah aur Abdur Rahman bin Sahl se farmaya: Kya tum qasmen khaoge aur apne sathi ke khoon ke haqdar hoge? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To kya Yahud tumhare liye qasmen khayenge? Unhon ne kaha: Woh Musalman nahin hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne paas se us ki diyat di aur unhen sau untniyan bhejin. Sahl ne kaha: Un mein se ek surkh untni ne mujhe lat mari. Muttafaq alaih."
"1021","[AI-translation] Ansar mein se ek aadmi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasamah ko baqi rakha jaise woh Jahiliyah mein thi, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ansar mein se kuch logon ke darmiyan us maqtool ke bare mein faisla kiya jis ka unhon ne Yahud par da'wa kiya tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1022","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ham par hathyar uthae woh ham mein se nahin hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1023","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo ita'at se nikle aur jama'at se juda ho aur mar jae to Jahiliyah ki maut hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1024","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ammar ko baghi giroh qatl karega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1025","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho Aey Ibn Umm Abd! Ke is ummat mein se jo baghawat kare us ke bare mein Allah ka hukm kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ziyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Us ke zakhmi par hamla na kiya jae, us ke qaidi ko qatl na kiya jae, us ke bhagne wale ka peecha na kiya jae, aur us ka maal taqseem na kiya jae. Ise Bazzar aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha magar wahm kiya; kyunke is ki sanad mein Kausar bin Hakim hai jo matrook hai. Aur Ali se sahih hai."
"1026","[AI-translation] Hazrat Arfajah bin Shuraij se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo tumhare paas aae jabke tumhara mamla jama ho aur woh tumhari jama'at ko todna chahe to use qatl karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1027","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jae woh shaheed hai. Ise Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"1028","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Ya'la bin Umayyah ne ek aadmi se ladayi ki to un mein se ek ne doosre ko kata aur us ka samne ka dant nikal liya. To unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jhagda kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi apne bhai ko kate jaise saannd katta hai? Us ke liye diyat nahin hai. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"1029","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu al-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar koi aadmi tum par baghair ijazat jhanke aur tum use kankari se maro aur us ki aankh phod do to tum par gunah nahin hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur Ahmad aur Nasai ke ek lafz mein hai aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha: To us ke liye na diyat hai na qisas."
"1030","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke deewaron ki hifazat din mein un walon par hai, aur maweshiyon ki hifazat raat mein un walon par hai; aur maweshi walon par hai jo un ke maweshi raat mein nuqsan pahunchayen. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ki sanad mein ikhtilaf hai."
"1031","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se us aadmi ke bare mein riwayat hai jo Musalman hua phir Yahudi ho gaya: Main na baithunga yahan tak ke qatl kiya jae, Allah aur Us ke Rasool ka faisla hai. To us ke bare mein hukm diya gaya aur qatl kiya gaya. Muttafaq alaih; aur Abu Dawud ki ek riwayat mein hai ke use us se pahle tauba karai gayi thi."
"1032","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna deen badle use qatl karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1033","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek nabina ki aulad wali bandi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko bura kehti aur Aap ki shan mein gustakhi karti thi; to woh use mana karta magar woh na rukti. Phir jab ek raat hui to us ne kudali li aur use us ke pet mein dala aur us par tek lagayi. To use qatl kar diya. To yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahunchi to Aap ne farmaya: Gawah raho ke us ka khoon zaya hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur is ke rawi siqah hain."
